          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick a song and press play. Notes fall toward the piano keys, and your child plays each one as it lands — right notes earn up to 3 stars. There is no losing; every finished song ends in a little celebration." : {
      "comment" : "Grown-Ups corner: how the game works, explained to a parent.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pick a song and press play. Notes fall toward the piano keys, and your child plays each one as it lands — right notes earn up to 3 stars. There is no losing; every finished song ends in a little celebration."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bir şarkı seç ve çal tuşuna bas. Notalar tuşlara doğru süzülür; çocuğun her notayı yere indiği anda çalar — doğru notalar 3 yıldıza kadar kazandırır. Kaybetmek yok; biten her şarkı küçük bir kutlamayla sona erer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
